+#   why a memorable phrase is unsafe: anyone who learns the name can test
+#   candidate secrets offline at hash speed. Generate it with:
+#     scripts/set-endpoint-topic-secret.sh
+#   It keeps no backup of the previous value; the setter prints only a
+#   fingerprint. Note that `endpoint` rewrites this file with yaml.dump
+#   whenever it saves config, which discards every comment in it.
 
 signal:
